<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-15T11:18:21.495Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:18:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi Prime Minister dismissed nine Babil officials over a fuel-smuggling case linked to Iran-backed militias and created a new special security force and an energy police unit to protect pipelines. Work has begun on a $3.95 million Saladin road and bridge project, while eight oil-company employees were detained for misusing funds and two people were detained in Maysan over more than 480 tons of missing rice. Kurdistan President Barzani delivered 33 key messages at the Erbil Green Belt launch and condemned the Khor Mor gas-field attack as an unforgivable crime, while Jordan sentenced three individuals to death for a church attack. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/11/13/trump-falsely-claims-nobodys-been-killed-iran-war-last-five-months/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPY01ndTg1a2ZYU3EtSG9adFdzclpBZi1fdkR3c2xWZGNNWXR2TDZEa1BmWVhkbkQ4dG4xR1JkSE1FUDJzUy1QUTBJa0FpeURWUHBkMkltZ1d1cFNWZmd0RmR1clQ4S1VDU0l0RlNyUmI2d0lSelpKZkZYMVZYWEY1Y0dhZE9HZGMxYWdnR2xVVG13OHhfTXFBeXpCbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;アラブニュース&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOSHJaU080bXhyT081NVo3MkxwN3NZWEhWRXBmSFg1dnBLVW5jM3VnSHRtV0Y0akNMb1lldWZSQy1pV2U1U0lXWTF3ajVIRG5OWDJyamY4Rk8tOW56SkhqX0hmU2pkWTJvcGYyemU0TTdmZTMwWHI5M3kxbkwxYVRPSDBFSG0?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxPbEdhMnJ1Um8tOFhHbE9qRldCSHNpei1jZGt5S25XNTQxcnczMy1kcXNoZU5EelF0amwyRGlVb1dwQi0wQmozVWZVVERCcXQ3VnhlQWV6T0RpcGlMMjExS3pkc25zbVJ4V1NESU9xV3N3WmRvX0dVdEc1YS14WW